       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4035.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * Actualização de Saldos de Extractos                            *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER              PIC X(40) VALUE 'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4035'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5807  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7302  END-EXEC.
      *
       01  DCLSWPARAM.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF SWPARAM  PREFIX BY 'SWPARAM-'.
       01  DCLNCCCBCOR.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF NCCCBCOR PREFIX BY 'NCCCBCOR-'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWPARAM                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
           05 CON-SWVT5807                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT5807'.
           05 CON-SWVT7302                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7302'.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.
           05 CON-CBAN-EXCLUDED            PIC  X(04) VALUE 'BMOC'.
           05 CON-SEM-SALDO                PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-COM-SALDO                PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-DATA-MINIMA              PIC  X(10)
                                                     VALUE '0001-01-01'.
           05 CON-PRDESC                   PIC  X(40) VALUE
                                                'Conta Correspondente'.
           05 CON-BOOLEAN                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'B'.
           05 CON-DEBITO                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-PRPARAM               PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-PRPARAM.
              10 WS-NCCCCBAN           PIC  X(04).
              10 WS-NCCCCSPAI          PIC  X(02).
              10 WS-NCCCMOED           PIC  X(03).
              10 FILLER                PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-DATE-TODAY            PIC  9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-FIRST-DATE            PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-PRVALDAT              PIC  9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-PARAGRAPH-NAME        PIC  X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CODIGO                PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 SW-NCCCBCOR-STATUS           PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-NCCCBCOR-OK                            VALUE  0.
              88 SW-NCCCBCOR-END                           VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-PARAM-STATUS              PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-PARAM-OK                               VALUE  0.
              88 SW-PARAM-NOTFND                           VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS           PIC  X(01)      VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-OK                            VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK                         VALUE 'N'.
      *
           05 SW-SWT58-STATUS              PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SWT58-OK                               VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SWT58-END                              VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-SALDO-STATUS              PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SALDO-OK                               VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SALDO-NOTOK                            VALUE -1.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCL0001.
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
           COPY SWCK0003.
           COPY SWCL5000.
           COPY VIAW0050.
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY BRCL1020.
           COPY AQCW0109.
      *    COPY AQCW0009.
           COPY AQCW0011.
           COPY SXCL1000.
           COPY ETCL9221.
           COPY SWCL5600.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
      *
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CRS_NCCCBCOR CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
                SELECT NCCCBALC
                     , NCCCCCB
                     , NCCCMOED
                     , NCCCCBAN
                     , NCCCCSPAI
                     , NCCCCCONTA
                  FROM NCCCBCOR
                 WHERE NCCCCBAN   NOT IN ( :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                                         , :CON-CBAN-EXCLUDED )
                   AND NCCCCSPAI  <> :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                   AND NCCCMOED   <> :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
                 ORDER
                    BY NCCCBALC
                     , NCCCCCB
                  WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CRS_SWT58    CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
                 SELECT CBAN
                      , CSPAI
                      , CMOED
                      , DATVAL
                      , MAX( COSN )
                   FROM SWVT5807
                  WHERE CBAN    =  :SWCD5807-CBAN
                    AND CSPAI   =  :SWCD5807-CSPAI
                    AND CMOED   =  :SWCD5807-CMOED
                    AND DATVAL  >  :SWCD5807-DATVAL
                  GROUP
                     BY CBAN
                      , CSPAI
                      , CMOED
                      , DATVAL
                  ORDER
                     BY DATVAL
                   WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40)
                                         VALUE 'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      ******************************************************************
      *                        LINKAGE SECTION                         *
      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
             UNTIL SW-NCCCBCOR-END
                OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS         REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-OK
                SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK          TO TRUE.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
              THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP        TO WS-DATE-TODAY
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 4100-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR
                 THRU 4199-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 4200-LER-NCCCBCOR
              THRU 4299-LER-NCCCBCOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                OR SW-NCCCBCOR-END
                OR SW-PRVALBOL-OK.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCD5807-COSN   = '9803062249'
              CONTINUE
           END-IF
      *
           PERFORM 5000-OBTER-DATA
              THRU 5099-OBTER-DATA-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 5100-ABRIR-SWT58
                 THRU 5199-ABRIR-SWT58-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 5200-LER-SWT58
                 THRU 5299-LER-SWT58-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 5300-TRATAR-SWT58
              THRU 5399-TRATAR-SWT58-EXIT
             UNTIL SW-SWT58-END
                OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           PERFORM 5400-FECHAR-SWT58
              THRU 5499-FECHAR-SWT58-EXIT.
      *
           SET  SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK          TO TRUE.
      *
           PERFORM 4200-LER-NCCCBCOR
              THRU 4299-LER-NCCCBCOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                OR SW-NCCCBCOR-END
                OR SW-PRVALBOL-OK.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE 'AQCW0009-RCODE'        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE AQCW0009-RCODE          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 4300-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR
              THRU 4399-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0009-TRATA-RCODE
              THRU AQCP0009-TRATA-RCODE-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       3099-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4100-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4100-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SPACES                     TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                                              NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                                              NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED.
      *
           SET  SW-NCCCBCOR-OK             TO TRUE.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_NCCCBCOR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR              TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT AQCW0011-OK
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                   VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'Erro OPEN Cursor'      TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       4199-ABRIR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4200-LER-NCCCBCOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4200-LER-NCCCBCOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_NCCCBCOR
               INTO :NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                  , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCONTA
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 PERFORM 7100-OBTER-PARAM
                    THRU 7199-OBTER-PARAM-EXIT
      *
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-NCCCBCOR-END      TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                     VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'Erro FETCH Cursor'   TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       4299-LER-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4300-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4200-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_NCCCBCOR
           END-EXEC.
      *
       4399-FECHAR-NCCCBCOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5000-OBTER-DATA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5000-OBTER-DATA'          TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO SWCD7302-CBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO SWCD7302-CSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO SWCD7302-CMOED.
           MOVE CON-SEM-SALDO              TO SWCD7302-ISALDEXT.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL( MAX( DATVAL ), :CON-DATA-MINIMA )
                INTO :SWCD7302-DATVAL
                FROM SWVT7302
               WHERE CBAN      =  :SWCD7302-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI     =  :SWCD7302-CSPAI
                 AND CMOED     =  :SWCD7302-CMOED
                 AND ISALDEXT  <> :SWCD7302-ISALDEXT
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7302              TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
      *       WHEN AQCW0011-FNC-NOT-FND
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 MOVE CON-DATA-MINIMA      TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-OK    TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro SELECT Saldo'  TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       5099-OBTER-DATA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5100-ABRIR-SWT58.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5100-ABRIR-SWT58'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET  SW-SWT58-OK               TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO SWCD5807-CBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO SWCD5807-CSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO SWCD5807-CMOED.
           MOVE SWCD7302-DATVAL            TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5807-DATVAL.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_SWT58
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5807               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT AQCW0011-OK
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                   VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'Erro OPEN Cursor'      TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       5199-ABRIR-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5200-LER-SWT58.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5200-LER-SWT58'           TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_SWT58
               INTO :SWCD5807-CBAN
                  , :SWCD5807-CSPAI
                  , :SWCD5807-CMOED
                  , :SWCD5807-DATVAL
                  , :SWCD5807-COSN
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5807               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-SWT58-END         TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                     VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'Erro FETCH Cursor'   TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       5299-LER-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5300-TRATAR-SWT58.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5300-TRATAR-SWT58'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 6000-OBTER-SALDO
              THRU 6099-OBTER-SALDO-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-SALDO-NOTOK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 PERFORM 6100-PREPARAR-LINHA
                    THRU 6199-PREPARAR-LINHA-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-SALDO-NOTOK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 PERFORM 6200-INSERIR-LINHA
                    THRU 6299-INSERIR-LINHA-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 5200-LER-SWT58
                 THRU 5299-LER-SWT58-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       5399-TRATAR-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5400-FECHAR-SWT58.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5400-FECHAR-SWT58'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_SWT58
           END-EXEC.
      *
       5499-FECHAR-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       6000-OBTER-SALDO.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '6000-OBTER-SALDO'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE SWCL5600-DATA         REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                 ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           PERFORM ETCP0003-STD-INIT
              THRU ETCP0003-STD-INIT-EXIT.
      *
           MOVE SWCD5807-COSN               TO SWCL5600-OSN.
      *
           CALL SWCL5600-ROTINA
              USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                    SWCL5600-DATA
              ON EXCEPTION
                 SET  ETCL0002-ERROS-ARQ    TO TRUE
                 MOVE VIAK0001-PROG-NOTFND  TO ETCL0002-NR-ERRO
                 MOVE ETCL0002-IND-ERROS    TO ETCL0002-CAPLIC-ERRO
                 MOVE SWCL5600-ROTINA       TO ETCL0002-CPROGRAM
           END-CALL.
      *
           PERFORM ETCP0003-STD-END
              THRU ETCP0003-STD-END-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN SWCL5600-ICE01 EQUAL SWCK0002-ICE-ERR
                 SET  SW-SALDO-NOTOK        TO TRUE
              WHEN NOT ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL    TO TRUE
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO AQCW0100-PARAGRAPH
                 MOVE 'MENS. MAL FORMATADA' TO AQCW0100-DESC1
                 MOVE 'ERRO MODULO SWM5600' TO AQCW0100-DESC2
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  SW-SALDO-OK           TO TRUE
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       6099-OBTER-SALDO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       6100-PREPARAR-LINHA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '6100-PREPARAR-LINHA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE DCLSWCD7302          REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           MOVE SWCD5807-CBAN              TO SWCD7302-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCD5807-CSPAI             TO SWCD7302-CSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC          TO SWCD7302-NBALC.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB           TO SWCD7302-CCB.
           MOVE SWCD5807-CMOED             TO SWCD7302-CMOED.
           MOVE SWCD5807-DATVAL            TO AQCW0005-DT98.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10             TO SWCD7302-DATVAL.
           MOVE SWCL5600-MSALD             TO SWCD7302-MSALDEXT.
           IF SWCL5600-CDBCR EQUAL CON-DEBITO
              MULTIPLY -1                  BY SWCD7302-MSALDEXT
           END-IF.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7302-CUSERID.
           MOVE CON-SEM-SALDO              TO SWCD7302-ISALDMOV.
           MOVE CON-COM-SALDO              TO SWCD7302-ISALDEXT.
      *
       6199-PREPARAR-LINHA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       6200-INSERIR-LINHA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '6200-INSERIR-LINHA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              INSERT
                INTO SWVT7302 (
                     CBAN
                   , CSPAI
                   , NBALC
                   , CCB
                   , CMOED
                   , DATVAL
                   , MSALDMOV
                   , MSALDEXT
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   , ISALDMOV
                   , ISALDEXT
                )
              VALUES (
                     :SWCD7302-CBAN
                   , :SWCD7302-CSPAI
                   , :SWCD7302-NBALC
                   , :SWCD7302-CCB
                   , :SWCD7302-CMOED
                   , :SWCD7302-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD7302-MSALDMOV
                   , :SWCD7302-MSALDEXT
                   , :SWCD7302-CUSERID
                   , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   , :SWCD7302-ISALDMOV
                   , :SWCD7302-ISALDEXT
                )
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7302               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN DB2-DUPREC
                 PERFORM 6210-ACTUALIZAR-LINHA
                    THRU 6219-ACTUALIZAR-LINHA-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO AQCW0100-PGMNAME
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO AQCW0100-PARAGRAPH
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO AQCW0100-NM-ENTIDADE
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO AQCW0100-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro INSERT tabela' TO AQCW0100-DESC1
                 PERFORM AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG
                    THRU AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       6299-INSERIR-LINHA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       6210-ACTUALIZAR-LINHA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '6210-ACTUALIZAR-LINHA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7302
                 SET MSALDEXT  =  :SWCD7302-MSALDEXT
                   , ISALDEXT  =  :SWCD7302-ISALDEXT
                   , CUSERID   =  :SWCD7302-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST   =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE CBAN      =  :SWCD7302-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI     =  :SWCD7302-CSPAI
                 AND NBALC     =  :SWCD7302-NBALC
                 AND CCB       =  :SWCD7302-CCB
                 AND CMOED     =  :SWCD7302-CMOED
                 AND DATVAL    =  :SWCD7302-DATVAL
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7302               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO AQCW0100-PGMNAME
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO AQCW0100-PARAGRAPH
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO AQCW0100-NM-ENTIDADE
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO AQCW0100-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro INSERT tabela' TO AQCW0100-DESC1
                 PERFORM AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG
                    THRU AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       6219-ACTUALIZAR-LINHA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       7100-OBTER-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '7100-OBTER-PARAM'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO WS-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO WS-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO WS-NCCCMOED.
      *
           SET  SW-PARAM-OK                TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE WS-PRPARAM                 TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT PRVALDAT
                   , PRVALBOL
                INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALBOL
                FROM SWPARAM
               WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALBOL     TO SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALDAT     TO WS-FIRST-DATE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-PARAM-NOTFND      TO TRUE
                 PERFORM 7200-CRIAR-PARAM
                    THRU 7299-CRIAR-PARAM-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro SELECT'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       7199-OBTER-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       7200-CRIAR-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '7200-CRIAR-PARAM'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN          TO WS-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI         TO WS-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED          TO WS-NCCCMOED.
      *
           MOVE CON-DATA-MINIMA            TO WS-FIRST-DATE.
      *
           SET  SW-PRVALBOL-OK             TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE WS-PRPARAM                 TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.
           MOVE CON-PRDESC                 TO SWPARAM-PRDESC.
           MOVE CON-BOOLEAN                TO SWPARAM-PRTIPPAR.
           MOVE WS-FIRST-DATE              TO SWPARAM-PRVALDAT.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWPARAM-PRVALNUM.
           MOVE SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS         TO SWPARAM-PRVALBOL.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWPARAM-PRVALALF.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWPARAM-CUSERID.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              INSERT
                INTO SWPARAM (
                     PRCODPAR
                   , PRPARAM
                   , PRDESC
                   , PRTIPPAR
                   , PRVALDAT
                   , PRVALNUM
                   , PRVALBOL
                   , PRVALALF
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEEST
                )
              VALUES (
                     :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                   , :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
                   , :SWPARAM-PRDESC
                   , :SWPARAM-PRTIPPAR
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALNUM
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALBOL
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                   , :SWPARAM-CUSERID
                   , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                )
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro INSERT'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       7299-CRIAR-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *    EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP9999 END-EXEC
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY AQCP0009.
           COPY SXCP1000.
           COPY ETCP9221.
      ******************************************************************
